WEBVTT

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:10.990
Summer vacation's going to be over soon.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:13.360
Yeah.

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:16.120
Then school's going to start.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.590
I can't wait!

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:18.640
Can't wait?

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:21.360
'Cause I'll get to see everyone in class again!

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.060
Everyone in class...

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:24.430
Tooruuun!

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:25.790
Watch it, Yutaka!

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:31.020
Ah, I didn't win again.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.050
By the way, Run-chan.

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:37.330
You always seem to be surrounded by guys.

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:38.380
Why is that?

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.620
Really? It doesn't seem that way to me.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:42.680
Why is that?

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:46.300
Have you ever been c-confessed to?

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:48.140
Confessed?

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:50.110
Come to think of it, the other day...

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:51.270
You have?

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.650
Satou-sensei gave me this.

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:54.980
Huh?

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:59.000
He gave it to me, saying, "I like this kind of thing."

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.540
Liking candles is pretty unusual, isn't it?

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:10.700
Are you sure... he means the candles?

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:12.090
Huh?

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:50.720
Hey, hey, look at this!

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:52.230
Want to go together?

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:53.510
What's this?

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:54.680
Oooh!

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:57.730
It's the fireworks festival they hold every year.

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:59.230
That's right.

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:01.320
There're lots of night stalls. It's pretty lively.

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.670
Really? Look, it's this weekend.

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:06.620
Since summer vacation's about to end,

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.400
it would be nice to go to a festival together.

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:10.070
It sure would.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.420
We can all wear yukata, too!

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:13.400
Sounds great!

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:14.140
Yeah.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:17.000
Well, it's fun to do this now and then.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:18.990
Then it's a date!

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:22.560
Hey,

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:24.280
what are you doing for the rest of today?

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:25.770
No plans.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.280
Too hot. Don't wanna move.

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:31.520
Hey, how about we go for karaoke?

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:34.320
Karaoke, huh?

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:37.530
Karaoke? Sounds good! I love karaoke!

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.070
Oh?

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.700
Yuuko, you're a karaoke fan?

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:44.390
Yep. I like to choose ringtones that I can sing along to.

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:45.450
Really?

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.490
Run, what do you like about karaoke?

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:52.480
Let's see... for one, the jambalaya at that place is amazing.

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:55.150
But the ramen's surprisingly good, too.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:58.710
Also, they give you big servings for the parfaits and ice cream!

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:01.040
Huh?

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:03.070
I thought we were going to karaoke?

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:04.590
Yep, we are.

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:09.900
This room's a bit cramped...

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:12.950
Ah, I'm going to order our food and drinks.

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:13.980
What would you all like?

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:15.920
I'll have a melon soda.

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:17.370
Grapefruit juice.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:20.040
Tooru, anything to drink?

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:22.190
Uh... iced tea.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:23.910
With pleasure!

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:29.770
Hey, they've got the new songs that came out this month.

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:31.970
I'll enter the first one.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:43.370
Okay, here I go!

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.160
Yuuko, not bad!

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:23.380
You're really good!

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.540
Thank you.

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:41.940
Ah, better enter the next one.

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:46.030
Huh?

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.170
<i>Tooru's giving this some serious thought.</i>

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:54.560
<i>Maybe she's really picky about something?</i>

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:57.630
Take your time deciding.

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:03.120
Why is she glaring at me?

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:07.380
All right, my turn!

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:49.870
Tooru.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:52.160
Done with the song book and staring contest?

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:55.300
Ah, this song?

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:56.490
I'll enter it for you.

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:57.030
Eh?

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:00.390
Okay! And, send!

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:13.950
Good job!

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:18.630
Go on.

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:20.220
It's starting!

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:22.350
Do your best, Tooru!

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:22.720
Eh?

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:24.280
Uh, um...

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:27.000
Here, the microphone!

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:33.240
What's wrong, Tooru?

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:51.890
Here's your order!

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:53.810
The jambalaya's here!

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:55.480
Ah,

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:57.160
I've got the grapefruit juice!

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:58.820
Here you go, Nagi-chan.

00:07:58.820 --> 00:07:59.600
Thank you!

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:01.280
The melon soda's mine.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:02.420
Here you go.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.090
Thank you.

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:05.570
Huh?

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:10.400
<i>Guess she didn't want to sing.</i>

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:12.670
<i>Sorry I almost made you.</i>

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:44.580
Lots of spirit there!

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.080
Just two more songs...

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:55.660
If I sing two more songs...

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.460
I can eat eight fries.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:59.650
Dieting?

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:01.100
Quit worrying and just eat.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:03.200
Hey, Tooru!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:05.420
Don't you like that song?

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:05.750
Huh?

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:09.190
This one, right here.

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:10.060
Right?

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:15.320
B-But I've never sung it before...

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:16.760
I probably can't.

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:22.200
You'll be fine!

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:23.830
Ah!

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:34.520
Tooru, it's not on!

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:36.120
Huh? Oh...

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:46.730
I'll start.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:48.350
<i>Run-chan...</i>

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:04.050
Just three more.

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:06.250
Don't know when to give up, huh?

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.810
Nobody's input another song?

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:12.480
Ah, then I'll do one.

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:15.180
Finish eating first.

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:18.850
Then the next song will be...

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:23.130
Someone next door?

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:24.430
I thought that was empty.

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:26.150
Maybe he just got here.

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:32.110
Wow, that guy's good.

00:11:32.110 --> 00:11:34.280
The song's so sultry it hurts, though.

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:38.880
It's starting!

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:40.830
Run-chan!

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:41.470
Don't sing!

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:43.270
Huh? Why?

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:44.190
Just because.

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:44.760
Huh?

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:45.610
Tooru!

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:46.290
Shh!

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:51.470
Don't tell me...

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:53.650
This voice...

00:11:58.490 --> 00:11:59.310
What?

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:00.850
What, what?

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.580
I wish I could sing karaoke with Run-chan.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:12.460
Okay, come on! One more time, here we go!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:28.340
Karaoke was so much fun!

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:30.840
Let's go again sometime!

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:33.470
I wish I was better at singing.

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:38.980
Come to think of it, they had a TV show about improving your singing.

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:39.740
Really?

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:51.660
It's been a while since I've worn a yukata to a festival.

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:53.920
I can't wait!

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:56.850
I've got a bunch of yukata. Which do you want?

00:12:56.850 --> 00:12:58.630
This one with the chic color is nice.

00:12:58.740 --> 00:12:59.940
It looks sophisticated.

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:01.080
Let me see...

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:03.860
I don't remember one with that color.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.370
Oh yeah.

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:08.670
This one's changed color from the mold.

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:14.810
I guess my current ones won't work.

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:17.840
Maybe my old ones will fit you?

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:20.020
I'll go get them.

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:28.050
<i>Those look very adult.</i>

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.600
<i>They're probably Run-chan's mom's.</i>

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:35.320
<i>Maybe I can break 1*0 cm in those.</i>

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:43.250
I'll never be an adult at this rate...

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:49.270
Mom!

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:49.770
Yes?

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:51.680
Oh, my!

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:54.120
Look! We put them on!

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:55.510
What do you think?

00:13:55.510 --> 00:13:57.940
Today's the festival, isn't it?

00:13:57.940 --> 00:14:00.190
Those bright colors are wonderful!

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:02.370
You both look spectacular.

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:03.660
Thanks!

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:05.200
Thank you very much.

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:08.110
But the festival isn't until tonight, right?

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:09.840
It's still ten in the morning.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:18.160
We got over-excited!

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:29.460
There they are!

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:30.950
Ah.

00:14:31.960 --> 00:14:33.610
Thanks for waiting.

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:35.180
Okay! We're all here.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:38.600
Yuuko-chan, you really do look cute in anything.

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:39.570
Well...

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:43.400
Nagi-chan- oh, you curled your hair!

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:44.320
You're right.

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:46.150
So she did.

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:47.610
It looks cute!

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:50.700
Well... you know... every now and then...

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.240
The fireworks won't start for a while,

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:55.740
so let's check out the stands to kill some time.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.960
Can we go to a mask stand first?

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:01.290
Sure.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:06.710
Tooru, do you like kids' anime?

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:07.380
No...

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:15.060
The stalls from the shopping district always try to give me stuff.

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:16.310
I feel guilty.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:17.980
Ah, so that's why.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:21.150
Ooh, a candy apple!

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:24.020
<i>Candy apple?</i>

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:26.780
Yuuko-chan, can I have a bite?

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:27.860
Go ahead.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:28.240
Here.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:30.990
Yummy!

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:34.450
Oh? Tooru, do you want some too?

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.450
I'm fine.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:36.200
Really?

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.410
Run, let me have some of your cotton candy, too!

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:39.870
Sure.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.290
Delicious!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:47.210
Huh?

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:48.920
What? Huh?

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:50.760
Whaaaat?

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.680
Yuuko-chan and Nagi-chan are doing the ring toss!

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:01.190
Ah! I got third place!

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:02.690
Congratulations!

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:04.400
Here! A fireworks set.

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:08.230
Giving fireworks as prizes at a fireworks festival?

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:10.320
All right! I'm up next!

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:12.320
I'm going for first place!

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:41.430
Uh-oh.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:44.310
I've already spent so much.

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:46.900
Night stalls are pretty expensive.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:48.770
You have to spend carefully.

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:52.070
Worst case, you end up broke for the second half of the festival.

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:55.410
But just looking at things makes you want them.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:17:01.120
That's why you have to deliberately buy things that you can enjoy for longer.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.040
Candy carving?

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:10.380
Nagi, shouldn't we do something we can all enjoy?

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:13.670
I'll bet you've never done candy carving before.

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:15.550
It's pretty fun.

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:16.930
Really?

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.350
Wanna give it a shot?

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.430
This is my first time.

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:24.140
You can pick an easy one, then!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:30.150
Oh no!

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:32.150
It broke!

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:34.110
Let me have another one!

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:34.990
Sure, miss.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.750
This is pretty tough.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.500
Come on, hurry up!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:53.380
But I haven't seen all the shops yet!

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:07.890
The fireworks started!

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:10.360
Everyone, hurry!

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:14.190
The crowds...

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:15.940
I know someplace good!

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:19.450
To the top of the hill! There's a secret spot there!

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:22.950
Nagi, forget about the candy carving!

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.750
My drinking gourd!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.710
It's right at the top of these stairs!

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:35.170
What?

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:39.680
Somehow, I don't really care about the fireworks anymore.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.140
Nagi, let's go!

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:42.680
Whaaat?

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:52.980
I can't go on!

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.320
Don't give in, Nagi-chan!

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.030
Don't be too late...

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:04.030
We're here!

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:09.710
Oh no...

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:23.850
All in a row!

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:24.760
Wow!

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.350
A... Amazing...

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:07.970
What?

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:10.480
It's over... already?

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:12.310
Oh no...

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:15.980
The finale alone just doesn't feel like enough.

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:18.110
It's kind of sad, isn't it?

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:18.610
Oh!

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:21.990
That's right! I won some fireworks at the stall earlier!

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:24.410
Oh yeah! Nice going, Yuuko!

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:25.870
But we don't have a light.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:28.490
Not to worry!

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:29.490
Matches?

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:30.750
A candle?

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.250
You brought those?

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:39.590
How come there were only sparklers in this thing?

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:41.550
How plain.

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:48.220
But I kind of like sparklers.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:53.980
Well, I suppose.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:57.440
They are pretty.

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:10.620
This tastes so good!

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:11.950
You've had way too much.

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.210
Ah...

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:16.120
Wha- Satou-sensei!

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:17.210
Why are you-

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:19.040
Now how do I respond to that?

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.920
Please don't come near me like that!

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:24.170
That's my line.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.470
By the way, sensei,

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:28.180
are you here alone?

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:30.390
I am not!

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:32.520
Get me another <i>Nama Sake!</i>

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:34.940
But look, you're alone!

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:37.900
Like I said! I am not alone!

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:39.190
There you go again...

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:54.700
Summer vacation was a lot of fun!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:57.080
Guess it was.

00:21:57.540 --> 00:21:59.000
We went to the beach, too.

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:01.840
Let's watch the fireworks again next year!

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:03.670
Sure!

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:06.340
I'll finish carving that candy next time, for sure!

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:08.550
So that's your priority?

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:10.850
What? It was fun, wasn't it?

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:13.850
Yep! It was surprisingly addicting.

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:15.480
Right, Tooru?

00:22:18.310 --> 00:22:18.980
Yeah.

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:20.900
It was fun.

00:23:57.650 --> 00:23:59.620
If you're talking about the end of August, you're thinking about...

00:23:59.620 --> 00:24:01.090
...the sound of cicadas, typhoons...

00:24:01.090 --> 00:24:02.580
...summer homework....

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:04.440
...Dad, who will finish your handicraft for you...

00:24:04.440 --> 00:24:06.090
...peeing in front of an abandoned house...

00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:07.840
...accidentally get caught while taking photos...

00:24:07.840 --> 00:24:10.590
I hastily drew the picture diary, but I don't remember what the weather was!

00:24:10.590 --> 00:24:12.720
...the newspaper that is being recycled before your very eyes...

00:24:14.330 --> 00:24:18.180
Even though it's like this, I still want to see this episode, Bibi-sensei!

00:24:18.180 --> 00:24:20.980
Next time, on A Channel, New Term.

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:23.660
Though we're not in elementary school anymore...
